        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-LVG100SBR, 1\" Diameter Wood Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1 Inch Diameter Wooden Appliance Handle comes with everything you need to install it on a refrigerator, freezer, or just about any other appliance in your home. Choose from a selection of <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbiw.pdf?v=1704262248\"> different types of wood</a> for the grip and a huge array of finishes for the brackets. This 1 Inch Diameter Wood Refrigerator Handle is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/livingston-wood-fashion-furniture-pull-first-impressions-lvg100003sbrt\"><b>1 Inch Diameter Wooden Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Livingston 01 Wood Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbiw.pdf?v=1704262248\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LVG01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262248\"><b>First Impressions LVG100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-LVG100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-LVG100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-LVG100036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Diameter Wooden Appliance Handle",
                "description": "The 1 Inch Diameter Wooden Appliance Handle comes with everything you need to install it on a refrigerator, freezer, or just about any other appliance in your home. Choose from  different types of wood for the grip and a huge array of finishes for the brackets. This 1 Inch Diameter Wood Refrigerator Handle is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. \r\n",
